# migrations/postgres/

PostgreSQL migrations for ${PROJECT_NAME}.

## What lives here

- Numbered SQL files (`NNN_description.sql`) applied in lexical order by
  [`scripts/run-migrations.ts`](../../scripts/run-migrations.ts).
- Each migration is wrapped in a transaction by the runner.

## What does NOT live here

- ORM-generated migrations (Prisma / Drizzle / TypeORM) — the stack here is
  intentionally pg-only. See the `Stack non-goals` section in the project
  scaffold plan.

## Naming

- `NNN_short_description.sql` — three-digit zero-padded prefix, snake_case,
  e.g. `001_init.sql`, `002_users.sql`.

## Linked files

- [`001_init.sql`](001_init.sql) — example migration, safe to delete.

